                <note rend="inline" type="source">667.003/132: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Smyrna</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Horton</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-29T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1921—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your July 23rd, 8 a.m. Your action approved. Keep the Department informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
